        _rl("OWASP Top 10 (Backend-Relevant)", "A standard, industry-maintained list of the most common and impactful web application security risks (Broken Access Control, Injection, Security Misconfiguration, etc.) — a baseline checklist any backend engineer is expected to know and defend against."),
